---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: output
input_file: examples/rooms.txt
---
$ rsbdd -t -f true examples/rooms.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
| reachable(Hall) | reachable(Kitchen) | reachable(Garden) | reachable(Shed) | reachable(Attic) | reachable(Cellar) | *     |
|-----------------|--------------------|-------------------|-----------------|------------------|-------------------|-------|
| True            | True               | True              | True            | False            | False             | True  |
--- stderr

$ rsbdd -v examples/rooms.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
reachable(Hall), reachable(Kitchen), reachable(Garden), reachable(Shed);
--- stderr

$ rsbdd -m -t -f true examples/rooms.txt
status: 10
--- stdout
| reachable(Hall) | reachable(Kitchen) | reachable(Garden) | reachable(Shed) | reachable(Attic) | reachable(Cellar) | *     |
|-----------------|--------------------|-------------------|-----------------|------------------|-------------------|-------|
| True            | True               | True              | True            | False            | False             | True  |
--- stderr
